{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_phaseabuildrecovery", "label": "Phase A \u2014 Build Recovery", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/recovery/phase-a-build-recovery.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_rc1_single_blob", "label": "RC-1 \u2014 Multi-File Code Generated as a Single Blob", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/recovery/phase-a-build-recovery.md", "source_location": "src/genesis/planning/health/HealthRuleEngine.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two modules concatenated into one file, the second carrying its own path header and a self-import. Git proves neither createHealthRuleEngine.ts nor HealthyRule.ts ever existed, so recovery from history was impossible and both had to be reconstructed from architectural evidence."}, {"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_rc2_import_depth", "label": "RC-2 \u2014 Wrong Relative Import Depth", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/recovery/phase-a-build-recovery.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Thirteen imports pointed at nonexistent paths while the target module existed elsewhere; none were missing implementations. Errors cascaded \u2014 four logger.ts errors resolved with one path fix."}, {"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_rc3_narrow_contracts", "label": "RC-3 \u2014 Contracts Narrower Than Their Only Implementation", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/recovery/phase-a-build-recovery.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "21 errors from interfaces omitting members their sole implementation and sole consumer both use. ModuleManifestSchema being a z.strictObject meant a manifest supplying the timeouts was rejected, making the feature unreachable by construction."}, {"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_rc4_name_collision", "label": "RC-4 \u2014 Same Name Declared by Two Subsystems", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/recovery/phase-a-build-recovery.md", "source_location": "src/genesis/index.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Five names re-exported via export * from two modules each (GoalStatus, HabitStatus, RelationshipStatus, GoalCategory, createDefaultStrategyRegistry), leaving them ambiguous and unusable through the barrel. These are genuinely different domain types sharing a name \u2014 a modelling collision, not a typo."}, {"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_rc5_stale_test_helpers", "label": "RC-5 \u2014 Stale Local Test-Helper Calls and Dead Config", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/recovery/phase-a-build-recovery.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "19 assertEquals/assertExists calls drifted from a convention 100 other call sites in the same file already followed."}, {"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_createhealthruleengine", "label": "createHealthRuleEngine.ts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/recovery/phase-a-build-recovery.md", "source_location": "src/genesis/planning/health/createHealthRuleEngine.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_healthyrule", "label": "HealthyRule.ts", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/recovery/phase-a-build-recovery.md", "source_location": "src/genesis/planning/health/rules/HealthyRule.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_recovery_phase_a_build_recovery_deliberateholds", "label": "Deliberate Holds \u2014 9 Errors Not Fixed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file